"""roulette: a zero-edge terminal roulette table.

Type ``roulette`` to sit down at a real single-zero (European) wheel: place
bets, watch the ball land, get paid. The house has NO edge -- landing on 0
pays bets on 0 at 36:1 and triggers a SUPER SPIN for every other bet, which
re-spins on 1-36 only, so every bet has an expected value of exactly zero.

``roulette --commands`` (or ``--russian``) spins the original wheel of
harmless, read-only shell commands and runs the winner.
"""

